  subgraph EDGE[Telnyx Edge Compute]
    API[forge-api<br/>Python Edge Function<br/>webhooks · 2 MCP servers · build pipeline<br/>console + workflow simulator]
    ST[forge-state<br/>TypeScript Function<br/>/rpc gateway]
    BP[(BuilderProfile<br/>1 per owner<br/>draft · lock · quota · inbox · alarm)]
    OM[(OpsMetrics global<br/>shared: API via RPC +<br/>alarms via binding)]
    RG[(AgentRegistry global)]
    CS[(ClinicSchedule<br/>1 per clinician)]
    CP[(ClinicPatient<br/>1 per patient)]
    CD[(ClinicDesk global)]
    KV[(Telnyx KV<br/>flags/global · flags/clinic<br/>agents/key · cache/polish · cache/triage<br/>session/chat)]
